abstract: >
  PerinatalKG is an OWL 2 knowledge graph integrating Brazilian perinatal
  (SINASC), climatic (BR-DWGD), mortality (SIM), and socioeconomic (IBGE)
  data. Proof-of-concept deployment covers Goiás state (2015–2024):
  934,806 births, 13,334,157 RDF triples, served via Apache Jena Fuseki 6.0.0.
